WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.563
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:28.833 --> 00:29.833
A rat…

3
00:31.900 --> 00:33.233
Are you dreaming?

4
00:34.533 --> 00:35.900
There's a rat…

5
00:37.000 --> 00:38.800
Talking in your sleep?

6
00:46.066 --> 00:47.665
You've got that weird habit too.

7
00:47.666 --> 00:49.333
You're the weird one.

8
00:50.300 --> 00:52.166
You… you were awake?

9
00:53.100 --> 00:54.366
Dreaming of your dad again?

10
00:57.733 --> 00:59.266
Not him this time.

11
01:01.900 --> 01:02.900
Then who?

12
01:05.433 --> 01:06.433
You.

13
01:08.233 --> 01:09.266
Me?

14
01:11.333 --> 01:13.433
You haven't even seen my face.

15
01:13.866 --> 01:15.400
So how'd you know it was me?

16
01:16.900 --> 01:17.900
Because...

17
01:19.100 --> 01:21.633
I know the way you smell.

18
01:28.033 --> 01:30.200
Song Yi.

19
01:30.533 --> 01:31.533
Xu Feiyu.

20
01:34.200 --> 01:35.300
Get up!

21
01:36.500 --> 01:37.500
Yong Qi.

22
01:37.900 --> 01:39.032
You're up early.

23
01:39.056 --> 01:40.688
Early my foot, look at the time.

24
01:41.200 --> 01:42.366
Is Feiyu still asleep?

25
01:43.133 --> 01:45.633
He… he's still asleep.

26
01:45.966 --> 01:46.366
Hey.

27
01:46.800 --> 01:48.533
Hey hey!

28
01:49.400 --> 01:50.433
Song Yi.

29
01:51.000 --> 01:51.300
Huh?

30
01:51.600 --> 01:53.066
You're acting strange.

31
01:54.800 --> 01:55.900
Strange how?

32
01:56.533 --> 01:57.533
Not at all…

33
01:58.733 --> 02:00.699
You two last night?

34
02:00.700 --> 02:01.933
We slept great last night.

35
02:02.390 --> 02:03.889
Out the second we laid down.

36
02:04.000 --> 02:05.333
Slept like babies.

37
02:07.033 --> 02:08.133
Really?

38
02:09.033 --> 02:10.066
Really.

39
02:11.700 --> 02:12.766
But then?

40
02:16.066 --> 02:17.200
So I hear you tried

41
02:17.366 --> 02:18.366
to sleep with Xu Feiyu?

42
02:19.100 --> 02:21.333
He… he told you even that?

43
02:21.966 --> 02:23.166
So no explanation for me?

44
02:23.766 --> 02:24.766
Ugh.

45
02:25.166 --> 02:27.966
I just wanted to try shock therapy.

46
02:28.200 --> 02:29.366
Never thought it'd fail.

47
02:29.833 --> 02:31.500
Sister Yun chewed me out for it.

48
02:34.000 --> 02:34.200
Tsk.

49
02:34.900 --> 02:35.900
Yong Qi

50
02:36.266 --> 02:38.699
I heard the line of guys chasing you in college

51
02:38.700 --> 02:39.700
stretched to Europe.

52
02:40.666 --> 02:41.966
None of them did it for you?

53
02:43.200 --> 02:44.800
You sure you're straight?

54
02:45.033 --> 02:45.266
Hm?

55
02:45.600 --> 02:46.766
What are you on about…

56
02:48.333 --> 02:49.333
Hold on.

57
02:49.800 --> 02:51.166
Song Yi.

58
02:51.500 --> 02:52.500
Hm?

59
02:53.500 --> 02:55.966
Don't tell me you're jealous over me?

60
02:57.500 --> 02:58.600
I'm not.

61
02:59.066 --> 02:59.500
Nonsense.

62
02:59.966 --> 03:01.066
So I'm right?

63
03:01.500 --> 03:02.300
Song Yi.

64
03:02.366 --> 03:04.065
No way.

65
03:04.066 --> 03:05.066
You're done for.

66
03:05.333 --> 03:06.766
You're really done for.

67
03:07.300 --> 03:08.300
I'm not, okay.

68
03:08.400 --> 03:09.400
Stop pointing.

69
03:10.033 --> 03:11.033
Oh.

70
03:13.466 --> 03:14.466
Careful, careful.

71
03:22.066 --> 03:22.533
Yong Qi

72
03:22.800 --> 03:23.566
I'm hungry.

73
03:23.566 --> 03:24.566
Look after him

74
03:24.766 --> 03:25.766
I'm off.

75
03:25.800 --> 03:27.800
He… he… he left?

76
03:28.566 --> 03:28.733
You…

77
03:29.200 --> 03:30.666
What were you two talking about?

78
03:31.500 --> 03:32.533
Xu Feiyu.

79
03:32.666 --> 03:34.699
How about you talk to me first

80
03:34.700 --> 03:36.133
about me trying to sleep with you?

81
03:36.833 --> 03:37.833
Um.

82
03:37.866 --> 03:38.866
I…

83
03:39.000 --> 03:39.433
That was…

84
03:39.733 --> 03:40.200
probably…

85
03:40.201 --> 03:41.966
me talking in my sleep last night…

86
03:44.233 --> 03:46.533
I didn't know Song Yi was such a gossip.

87
03:46.800 --> 03:48.833
And you're one to talk?

88
03:49.033 --> 03:50.033
What's he done to you

89
03:50.034 --> 03:51.200
these past few days?

90
03:51.533 --> 03:53.165
Are you two close enough now

91
03:53.166 --> 03:54.866
to be sharing secrets like that?

92
03:56.300 --> 03:59.466
It's not exactly a secret.

93
03:59.700 --> 04:01.799
No reason to hide it.

94
04:01.800 --> 04:02.800
Huh?

95
04:03.000 --> 04:04.966
Who exactly is hiding anything?

96
04:05.066 --> 04:05.333
You...

97
04:05.566 --> 04:06.933
What are you getting at?

98
04:10.300 --> 04:11.933
Don't say I didn't warn you.

99
04:12.100 --> 04:14.300
Song Yi has no sense of boundaries.

100
04:14.600 --> 04:15.900
Don't let him lead you astray.

101
04:18.300 --> 04:20.033
He's the carer you hired for me.

102
04:20.233 --> 04:21.366
You could've told me.

103
04:21.500 --> 04:22.500
Huh?

104
04:22.800 --> 04:23.800
Ugh.

105
04:24.466 --> 04:25.900
Okay okay okay.

106
04:29.633 --> 04:31.500
Breakfast is ready on the table.

107
04:31.833 --> 04:32.833
Go on and eat.

108
04:33.266 --> 04:33.733
Okay.

109
04:33.900 --> 04:34.833
Eat with me.

110
04:34.866 --> 04:36.131
No, I have to run to the shop.

111
04:36.166 --> 04:37.166
You go ahead.

112
04:37.500 --> 04:38.500
Mm.

113
04:38.600 --> 04:39.733
All right then.

114
04:43.333 --> 04:44.433
Song Yi.

115
04:46.200 --> 04:47.200
Song Yi!

116
04:47.733 --> 04:48.833
Yeah! I'm coming.

117
04:51.100 --> 04:52.533
Walk me to the parking lot.

118
04:53.533 --> 04:54.533
Sure thing.

119
05:03.833 --> 05:05.946
What're you looking at with that look?

120
05:07.200 --> 05:09.165
Ever since you showed up

121
05:09.166 --> 05:10.966
I feel like Feiyu's become...

122
05:11.300 --> 05:12.300
a different person.

123
05:12.400 --> 05:13.400
That's not normal.

124
05:16.000 --> 05:17.000
So what?

125
05:17.333 --> 05:19.339
Is how he is now bad?

126
05:20.233 --> 05:23.156
I don't know if this is good for him or bad.

127
05:23.766 --> 05:24.766
Song Yi.

128
05:24.900 --> 05:26.966
Do you really see Feiyu as a little brother?

129
05:30.633 --> 05:32.533
I don't even know what you're saying...

130
05:33.766 --> 05:34.766
Oh right.

131
05:35.042 --> 05:35.976
Weren't you off to the shop?

132
05:36.001 --> 05:37.300
Don't change the subject

133
05:37.400 --> 05:39.100
I know exactly what you're thinking.

134
05:40.166 --> 05:42.100
You two are already swapping clothes.

135
05:42.533 --> 05:44.599
You come barging into his life

136
05:44.600 --> 05:45.600
and if one day

137
05:45.601 --> 05:47.000
he learns about you and Song Yang,

138
05:47.253 --> 05:48.253
what then?

139
05:49.166 --> 05:50.466
Come on that's enough

140
05:50.666 --> 05:52.200
I know what I'm doing.

141
05:52.633 --> 05:53.932
Go on hurry back.

142
05:53.933 --> 05:54.999
Customers are waiting.

143
05:55.000 --> 05:55.900
The obss lady's not there.

144
05:55.900 --> 05:56.900
That's no good.

145
05:57.066 --> 05:58.132
Go on, get going.

146
05:58.133 --> 05:59.133
Go, go.

147
05:59.400 --> 06:00.200
Hurry back.

148
06:00.200 --> 06:01.200
Go.

149
06:08.666 --> 06:09.666
Mm.

150
06:14.033 --> 06:15.166
I've gotta say.

151
06:15.433 --> 06:16.700
Yong Qi's cooking

152
06:16.866 --> 06:17.866
is unbeatable.

153
06:18.366 --> 06:19.366
Whatever she makes

154
06:19.400 --> 06:20.733
comes out Michelin-level.

155
06:23.733 --> 06:25.000
Fries.

156
06:35.133 --> 06:35.733
Say ahh.

157
06:35.900 --> 06:37.500
Ahh.

158
06:49.866 --> 06:51.133
Tell me

159
06:51.533 --> 06:52.533
when your eyes heal

160
06:52.966 --> 06:55.133
what do you most want to do?

161
06:56.266 --> 06:57.633
Would you…

162
06:57.933 --> 06:59.533
want to do it with me?

163
06:59.733 --> 07:00.133
Yeah.

164
07:00.533 --> 07:01.533
I'll do it with you.

165
07:02.466 --> 07:04.033
That's not an answer.

166
07:04.433 --> 07:06.400
Doing it isn't the same as wanting to.

167
07:07.633 --> 07:08.733
What's the difference?

168
07:09.166 --> 07:10.166
Just say it.

169
07:10.332 --> 07:11.332
What do you want to do?

170
07:13.100 --> 07:14.366
There's tons of things.

171
07:15.866 --> 07:16.866
Then tell me

172
07:17.033 --> 07:18.966
the first one that pops into your head.

173
07:21.633 --> 07:23.433
Mm…

174
07:26.566 --> 07:27.566
Sunrise

175
07:27.766 --> 07:29.666
I want to paint a sunrise from a mountaintop.

176
07:30.800 --> 07:31.800
That's easy.

177
07:32.200 --> 07:33.966
Sure, I'll take you.

178
07:34.166 --> 07:34.966
Really?

179
07:35.000 --> 07:36.000
Yeah

180
07:36.066 --> 07:37.400
I want to see the sunrise too.

181
07:37.866 --> 07:39.233
Then it's a promise.

182
07:39.533 --> 07:40.533
No backing out!

183
07:42.066 --> 07:43.066
Yeah.

184
07:43.100 --> 07:44.100
It's a promise.

185
07:48.666 --> 07:49.666
Say ahh.

186
08:06.100 --> 08:07.100
Mmm.

187
08:12.666 --> 08:13.666
Mm.

188
08:14.066 --> 08:14.400
This.

189
08:15.033 --> 08:16.700
What is this thing?

190
11:12.233 --> 11:13.233
Sister Yun?

191
11:14.300 --> 11:16.133
Weren't you coming back next week?

192
11:16.333 --> 11:17.433
Why are you back early?

193
11:18.566 --> 11:19.166
Any later

194
11:19.166 --> 11:20.166
and the flowers wilt.

195
11:20.666 --> 11:21.666
You're so sweet.

196
11:22.033 --> 11:22.366
Come on

197
11:22.533 --> 11:24.000
give me one of those mom hugs.

198
11:25.266 --> 11:26.266
Come here.

199
11:28.900 --> 11:29.733
Here you go.

200
11:29.866 --> 11:31.066
Thanks.

201
11:31.766 --> 11:32.233
Oh right

202
11:32.400 --> 11:34.199
I got home and Xu Feiyu wasn't there

203
11:34.200 --> 11:35.266
I thought he was here.

204
11:35.500 --> 11:35.966
Oh.

205
11:36.233 --> 11:38.332
Song Yi took him out to clear his head.

206
11:38.333 --> 11:40.933
Don't worry, if they're together he's fine.

207
11:41.333 --> 11:43.699
Seems that junior of yours isn't bad.

208
11:43.700 --> 11:45.033
Don't get me started,

209
11:45.133 --> 11:46.533
he's a handful too.

210
11:46.700 --> 11:48.932
But this time those two

211
11:48.933 --> 11:50.566
seem like two peas in a pod.

212
11:51.966 --> 11:52.966
Whoo!

213
11:55.933 --> 11:56.933
Whoo!

214
12:04.366 --> 12:05.366
Whoo!

215
12:07.700 --> 12:08.700
Oh sorry.

216
12:11.933 --> 12:12.933
Whoo!

217
12:13.666 --> 12:14.666
Hey?

218
12:14.733 --> 12:16.099
That guy over there

219
12:16.100 --> 12:17.399
did he come with you?

220
12:17.400 --> 12:18.632
Introduce us.

221
12:18.633 --> 12:20.366
He's… my little brother.

222
12:20.610 --> 12:21.742
He's so hot,

223
12:21.766 --> 12:23.532
just my type of puppy boy.

224
12:23.533 --> 12:24.700
Puppy boy?

225
12:24.933 --> 12:27.132
You've never seen him get mean.

226
12:27.133 --> 12:28.232
Even a mastiff runs.

227
12:28.233 --> 12:29.000
He bites.

228
12:29.001 --> 12:30.032
Oooh~

229
12:30.033 --> 12:31.665
I'm warning you don't go near him.

230
12:31.666 --> 12:32.666
Hey!

231
12:32.933 --> 12:33.166
Hey!

232
12:33.500 --> 12:34.500
Hey handsome

233
12:34.733 --> 12:36.233
add me on WeChat?

234
12:36.633 --> 12:37.932
He's my real little brother

235
12:37.933 --> 12:39.032
so hands off.

236
12:39.033 --> 12:40.833
Our house rule is no dating while young.

237
12:41.766 --> 12:43.066
I don't mind.

238
12:43.366 --> 12:45.032
It's just WeChat

239
12:45.033 --> 12:46.699
I'm sure my "big brother"

240
12:46.700 --> 12:48.065
wouldn't mind, would he?

241
12:48.066 --> 12:49.099
Hmm

242
12:49.100 --> 12:50.100
I see.

243
12:50.200 --> 12:51.000
Hey, handsome.

244
12:51.001 --> 12:52.032
What's with your eyes?

245
12:52.033 --> 12:53.199
Blinded by my good looks.

246
12:53.223 --> 12:53.923
Satisfied now?

247
12:54.200 --> 12:55.599
Nothing to see, go dance.

248
12:55.600 --> 12:56.733
All right, break it up.

249
12:56.933 --> 12:58.000
Go on, go on, go on.

250
13:00.166 --> 13:01.699
Quite the player, huh.

251
13:01.700 --> 13:03.100
And I don't even have your WeChat.
